    "body": "There is a good write-up on this behavior at https://axesslab.com/skip-links/\n\nHi @anevins12, “implementation issues/bugs” refers to cases where the observed behavior deviates from the specification due to how it’s currently implemented in browsers or assistive technologies.\nYou can check and file new issues from the links in this article: https://www.digitala11y.com/how-where-to-report-accessibility-bugs/",
